tream has occurred.","wo":"Su fekke ni njëg bu njëkk bi dafa weesu bu mujju bi, kon ci misaal yebeefu mbir bi am nekk na.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou feké ni ndieug bou ndieuk bi dafa wésou bou moudiou bi kone thi misal yébééfou mbir bi ame neuk na.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1006,"row":{"en":"If you don't start acting like adults, then I'm going to have to cut you out of my life.","wo":"Su ngeen nanguwul def seen bopp ay mag, dama leen di génne ci sama dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou ngéne nangouwoul def séne bopp ay mag dama léne di guéné si sama doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1007,"row":{"en":"I'm writing to you from our family farm, where the harvest has been going well this year.","wo":"Maa ngi lay bindee ci sunu toolu famiy, ren noo ngi ci góob bi, lépp a ngi jaar yoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMaa ngui lay bindé si sounou toolou famille bi, rén gno ngui si goob bi, lép a ngui diar yoon.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1008,"row":{"en":"Over the centuries, science has developed into a more rigorous discipline, with the development of the scientific method, which emphasizes evidence, hypothesis testing, and repeatability.","wo":"Jamono di dox, science demna ba mujjee nekk bànxaas bu ñeme coono liggéey, lal ko ci anamu gëstub science, maanaam fësal firnde, saytu balaa wax, ak mëna baamtu liggéeyam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJamono di dokh, science demna ba moudié nek bankhass bou nieme coño liguey, lal ko thi anamou geustoube science, manaam feussal firnde, saytou bala wakh, ak meuna baamptou ligueyam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1009,"row":{"en":"1. Preheat the oven to 180 degrees.","wo":"1. Njëkkal tàngal fuur bi ba 180 degre.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdieukal tangal four bi ba 180 degré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1010,"row":{"en":"A: Do you think the dowry system is a good 