_idx":1016,"row":{"en":"Dance and be free Henry looked at the old woman with confusion.","wo":"Feccal nga moom sa bopp Henry xool ku jigéen ki ak jaaxle.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFeuthial nga mom sa bopp henry khol kou djiguéne ki ak diakhle.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1017,"row":{"en":"Science has had a profound impact on human society, leading to the development of new technologies, medicines, and understanding of the natural world.","wo":"Barina coppite yu am solo yu science indi ci dundu doomi aadama yi, moo jiite jéego yu mag yi am ci teknolosi, ci paj, ak xam mbir yiy xew ci àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina coppité you am solo you science indi si doundou domi adama yi, mo djité djégo you magui yi am si teknolosi, si paj, ak ham mbir yiy hew si addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1018,"row":{"en":"There are a variety of treatments available for UTIs, bladder stones, and kidney diseases.","wo":"Amna xeeti pajum yu bari yu jàppandi ngir UTI, donj deret ak feebaru rein.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna kheti padjoum you bari you diapandi nguir UTI donj deret ak febarou rein.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1019,"row":{"en":"They use a variety of processes to cool their contents, including: * Condenser coils: These coils are located on the back or bottom of the refrigerator and are responsible for transferring heat from the inside of the refrigerator to the outside air * Evaporator coils: These coils are located inside the refrigerator and are responsible for absorbing heat from the air inside the refrigerator * Refrigerant: This is a special fluid that circulates through the refrigerator and absorbs heat from the air inside the refrigerator.","wo":"Barina pexe yu ñuy jëfandikoo ngir seddal li nekk ci biir frigo bi, lu ci melni: * Serpentin yu kondensatër bi: Yooyu serpentin ñu ngi nekk ci ginaaw wala ci suufu frigo bi, ñoom ñooy jël tàngoor wi ci frigo bi ñu génn ko ci air bi ci biti * Serpentin evaporatër yi: Yooyu serpentin ñu ngi nekk ci biir frigo bi te ñooy xëcci tàngoor wi ci air bi ci biir frigo bi * Refrigerant bi: Benn gaas la bu daw ci biir frigo bi ba noppi di naan tàngoor wi ci biir frigo bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina pexe you gnuy dieufandiko nguir sedal li neuk thi biir frigo bi, lou thi melni: * Serpentin you condensateur bi: Yooyou serpentin gnou ngui neuk thi guinaw wala thi soufou frigo bi, gnom gnoy dieul tangor wi thi frigo bi gnou guenn ko thi air bi thi biti * Serpentin evaporateur yi: Yooyou serpentin gnou ngui neuk thi biir frigo bi té gnoy kheuthie tangor wi thi air bi thi biir frigo bi * Refrigerant bi: Benn gaas la bou daw thi biir frigo bi ba nopi di naan tangor wi thi biir frigo bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1020,"row":{"en":"The festival is a time for celebration and thanksgiving, and it involves traditional music, dancing, and food.","wo":"Festival bi, dañu koy amal ngir am luñuy màggal wala muy cant, dafay way ak feccu cosaan te dafay am lekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFestival bi daniou koy amal nguir ame lougnouy magal walla mouy cante dafay waye ak feuthie thiossane té dafay ame lekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1021,"row":{"en":"Premium Plus trim adds a rear park assist camera, quick-fold front passenger seat, and grocery bag holder.","wo":"Finisioŋu Premium Plus dafay yokk benn kameraa bu lay jàppale sooy gaare, chaise pasaage bi ci kanam buy gaawa lemu, ak fooy teg sac booy def say ndugg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFinision premium plus dafay yok bene caméra boulay diapale so gaaré, chaise passagé bi si kanam bouy gawa lemu, ak fo tégg sac bouy def say ndugg.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1022,"row":{"en":"They spent the next few months working on a new recipe for a cake that would be infused with the linguist's love of language and the pastry chef's love of baking.","wo":"Weer yi ci topp ñu nekk di liggéey ci rëset bu bees ngir gato buy boole jaxase mbëggeel làkk gu jëkkër ji ak mbëggeelu patisëri bu jabar ji.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWéer yi thi top gnou nek di liguey thi ruset bou bess nguir gato bouy boolé diakhassé mbeuguel lakk gou dieukeur dji ak mbeuguelou patisserie bou djabar dji.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1023,"row":{"en":"These changes are making it more difficult to grow some crops in certain areas, while at the same time creating new opportunities for agriculture in other areas.","wo":"Coppite yooyu tax na ba amna xeetu mbay yu bari yu gëna jafe bay ci yenn gox yi, waaye ci yeneen gox yi ñu ngi wut yeneen pexe yu bees ci wàllu mbay mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCoppité yoyou takhna ba amna khettou mbaye you bari you geuna diaffé baye thi yenn goh yi wayé thi yénéne goh yi gnoungui wout yénéne pexé you bess ci wallou mbaye mi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1024,"row":{"en":"Vast archives of military photos have been digitized and made available online, allowing researchers to study them from anywhere in the world.","wo":"Amna ay nataali soldaar yu yàgg yu skane dugal leen ci net bi, suko defee gëstukat yi di leen mëna jàngat fépp fu ñu mëna nekk ci àdduna bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna ay natali soldat you yague you scan dougal len ci net bi souko défé guestoukat yi di len meuna diangat fépp fou gnou meuna nekk ci aduna bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1025,"row":{"en":"And if you're ever not sure whether or not it's safe, just don't do it.","wo":"Te sudee leerula ndax wóor na am déet, bul ci klike.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTei soudé leeroula ndakh woor na ame déet boul thi klikeu.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1026,"row":{"en":"In this case, the headache was the result of a particularly trying day at work.","wo":"Waaye li waraloon metitu bopp bii bisu liggéey bu metti, doon jée