lé bi moy dieufandiko souniou service you yeuglé bou bess bignou geuna defar nguir yeugali sen dieund si Amazon!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1051,"row":{"en":"Were the organizational roles and responsibilities clearly identified?","wo":"Ndax leeraloon nañu baax cër ak wareefu mbootaay gi?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdakh léralone nagnou bakh ceur ak warefou mbootaay gui?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1052,"row":{"en":"Instead, he suggested that resilience and adaptation should play a stronger role in how humans relate to fire.","wo":"Waaye limu xalaat mooy ndimbal ak fexe mën ànd dina jàppale nit ñi ci lu jëm ci xal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé limou khalaat moy ndimbeul ak fékhé meun ande dina diapalé nitt gni thi lou dieum thi khaliss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1053,"row":{"en":"Cleaning Up jumps from upsetting social drama to hilarious buddy comedy to tense heist thriller.","wo":"Cleaning Up a ngi dooree ci drame sosiaal bu tiis dem ci komedi bu xoromu diggantey xarit mujjee nekk thriller bu doy waar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCleaning Up a ngui doré ci drame social bou tiiss dem ci komedi bou khoromou diggantéy kharit moudjé neuk thriller bou doy waar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1054,"row":{"en":"import","wo":"bagaasu bitim réew jëndi bitim réew","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nbagassou bitim rew dieundi bitim rew\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1055,"row":{"en":"You have to work hard to get what you want.","wo":"Da ngeen wara liggéey, faj seeni soxla.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDa ngen wara liguey fadj seni sokhla.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1056,"row":{"en":"It was the kind of headache that made you want to tear your hair out, or at least write a strongly worded letter to the makers of whatever it was that had given you the headache in the first place.","wo":"Mooy xeetu bopp buy metti boo xamni sula dalee dangay bëgga buddi sa kawar yi sànni, sa xel du nekk ludul ci xool fu saaga gëna ñaawee nga njëkka saaga ki la teg metitu bopp bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoy khettou bopp bouy meti bo khamni soula dalé dangay beuga boudi sa kawar yi sanni, sa hel dou nekk loudoul thi khol fou saga geuna gnawé nga ndieuka saga ki la tegg métitou bopp bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1057,"row":{"en":"As a result, the teeth eventually develop a dull, lackluster appearance.","wo":"Loolu mooy waral bën yi dem oos, baña weet tàll.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLolou moy waral been yi dem oss bagna wét tall.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1058,"row":{"en":"The beggar smiled and told her that he would be happy to teach her.","wo":"Yalwaankat bi daal di muuñ ni ko dina am mbégte ci jàngal la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYalwaankat bi daldi mougn niko dina ame mbeugté si diangal la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1059,"row":{"en":"I am based at a university located near the French border, and I have had the opportunity to collaborate with scholars from France and other Francophone countries.","wo":"Maa ngi nekk ci universite bu nekk ci fronceeru France, te dinaa mëna liggéeyandoo ak ay universiteer yu bawoo France ak ci yeneen réew yuy làkk français.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMaa ngui nekk ci université bou nekk ci fronceeru France, té dinaa meuna ligueyando ak ay universiteer you bawoo France ak ci yenen réew youy lakk français.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1060,"row":{"en":"Patient: Eating seems to make it worse, especially fatty or greasy foods.","wo":"Malaad bi: Suma lekkee dafay melni lu koy gëna yokk, rawatina lekk yu niin yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMalaad bi: Souma lékké dafay melni loukoy geuna yok, rawatina lekk you gnii gnii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1061,"row":{"en":"Vehicle repai