nie daa ray benn jigéen te tayu ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé seen yakar yeup keppouwat ndakh lennie da ray bene djiguéne té tayouko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1096,"row":{"en":"After a few hours, my name was called, and I was ushered into a small room with a computer.","wo":"Ginaaw ay waxtu yu néew, ñu woo sama tur, ñu yóbbu ma ci saal bu ndaw bu am benn ordinatër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw ay wakhtou you néw, gnou woo sama tour, gnou yobou ma thi salle bou ndaw bou ame bene ordinateur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1097,"row":{"en":"We need to be able to let go of the things that are no longer serving us, and we need to be able to let go of the things that we are attached to out of fear or insecurity.","wo":"Fàww nu mëna teggi sunu bakkan ci mbir yi nu amalatul njariñ, te itam fàwwu nu mëna teggi sunu bakkan ci mbir yiñ jàpp ni ñooy tay dunu am lunu ragal wala dunu ñàkk kaaraange.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFaw gnou meuna tegui souniou bakane thi mbir yi gnou amalatoul ndiarigne té itame faw gnou meuna tegui souniou bakane thi mbir yign diap ni gnoy tay douniou ame lougnou ragal wala douniou gnakk kaaraangé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1098,"row":{"en":"The film shows that girls can be just as good as boys at sports, and that they should not be held back by their gender.","wo":"Filmu bi dafay wane ni jiggéen mën nañu def ci tàggat-yaram lépp lu ci góor mëna def, te ñu bàyyi naan jigéen lañu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFilm bi dafay wané ni djiguéne meun nagnou def ci taggat yaram leup lou ci goor meuna def té gnou bayi naan djiguéne lagnou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1099,"row":{"en":"Honestly, if you consider yourself a bro and have never been to Vegas, get your bros together and go.","wo":"Ci dëgg nak, bu fekke ni denga jappe sa boppu ni ab xarit te mosulo dem Vegas, dajalel say xarit te and ak ñoom.","non_standar